'''Leagues II - Trailblazer:''' We are very nearly ready to share the release date. This Gazette has a fantastic design article for you to sink your teeth into and you can catch up on all things Leagues by checking out 1) [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/leagues-ii---trailblazer?oldschool=1 the announcement blog], 2) [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qtTRKdxdmtM the announcement stream] , 3) [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/leagues-ii---trailblazer-reward-poll-blog?oldschool=1 the rewards blog] and 4) [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IViuol1eDRY the rewards stream] .

